{"title": "Exploit Weakness", "pageid": 28112, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Exploit_Weakness", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (disambiguation)\">Aura of Murder (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Exploit Weakness</b> is a passive feature that makes targets vulnerable to being pierced.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creatures hit with this weapon receive <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerability\">Vulnerability</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Murder_.28debuff.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Murder_(debuff)\"> Condition: Aura of Murder (debuff) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(debuff)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (debuff) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Murder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(debuff)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (debuff) (Condition)\">Aura of Murder</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst\" title=\"Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst\" title=\"Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst\">Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Clover\" title=\"The Clover\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Clover\" title=\"The Clover\">The Clover</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Exploit Weakness is only applied by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a> and only when used in melee combat; <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">throwing</a> this weapon does not apply the passive.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Inflicts <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerability\" clas